From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: momokind <momokind2002@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [VideoPlayer] Convert HDR10+ ST 2094-40 dynamic metadata to Dolby Vision Profile 8.1

Reuse the HDR Vivid -> Dolby Vision Profile 8.1 pipeline to detect HDR10+
streams (via container HDR_TYPE_HDR10PLUS or in-band HEVC ITU-T T.35 ST
2094-40 SEI) and convert per-frame AVDynamicHDRPlus (maxscl, average_maxrgb,
distribution_maxrgb) into Dolby Vision Profile 8.1 L1 dynamic metadata for
pi-dv-engine.
